OL,3,AIsraeli families remember those killed
OL,4,Ain 7 October attacks at national
OL,5,Amemorial
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraelis are marking three years since
OL,8,Fthe Hamas-led attack on 7 October 2023,
OL,9,Fin which about 1,200 people were killed
OL,10,Fand 251 others were taken hostage
OL,12,FVigils are being held across Israel and
OL,13,Fthe world, including a national
OL,14,Fmemorial in Tel Aviv
OL,16,FAn event has also been held at the site
OL,17,Fof the Nova music festival, where 378
OL,18,Fpeople were killed and 44 taken
OL,19,Fhostage. Moran Stella Yanai, a former
OL,20,Fhostage taken from the festival, says
OL,21,F"happiness turned into horror" that day
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
